        rdfs:label "Bilsborough et al. (2011), Barkoulas et al. (2008), Vlad et al. (2014) & Kierzkowski et al. (2019) growing leaf margin PIN1-Auxin-CUC2-RCO feedback loop and serration vs compound leaflet dissection — Morphological realism / specimen match: 45/100" ;
